Added `FilterTestCase.test_filters_coverage`, a generic test that fails when any filter on the FilterSet under test is not exercised by a `generic_filter_tests` entry or by a test method named `test_<filter_name>`, unless the filter is acknowledged in the test case's `untested_filters` list. Entries in `untested_filters` are themselves checked for staleness, so the list can only shrink.
Added automatic generic filter tests for the `created` and `last_updated` filters of every FilterSet, and `FilterTestCase.test_dynamic_groups_filter` for the `dynamic_groups` filter of every dynamic-group-associable model.
Recorded the currently untested filters on every core FilterSet test case in `untested_filters`, to be worked down in follow-up changes.
Extended `FilterTestCase.test_boolean_filters_generic` to also test plain `BooleanFilter` filters on model `BooleanField`s, in addition to `RelatedMembershipBooleanFilter`.
Changed `FilterTestCase.test_filters_generic` to build its expected queryset from each filter's `lookup_expr` instead of always using `__in`, so filters with `icontains` and similar lookups (including the auto-generated `JSONField` filters) can be listed in `generic_filter_tests`.
